# Wave T56 (Palmside kit): coralfloor — Palmside's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). CORAL FLAGSTONE: large fitted flags in warm coral-rose stone with cream grout on an offset grid, sand speckle in the grout and a paler worn sheen at each flag's centre — the painting's hard roads in the game's one pixel family. A FITTED-FLAG GRID IN A WARM ROSE REGISTER: unlike Brightshore's panelfloor (a rigid golden photovoltaic grid — the sister family this town shipped as), Clashfield's basaltfloor (dark fitted slabs, rust flecks), Bridgeport's ringfloor (ringed quay stone), Heritage's heritagefloor (teal flags). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T56-PALMSIDE-PLAN.md §5.)
